{"schema_version": 2, "model": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 36, "modulus_bits": 16}, "seed": 752716821, "solved": "failed", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": false, "verify_reason": "coefficient U[7][0] is outside 0..65536", "reply": "Answering this recovers the 36 Groebner basis polynomials $B_i = x_i^2 + U[i][0]ab + U[i][1]cd$ directly from the given affine linear relations among the generators.\n\nEach given generator $R_r$ has the form:\n$$R_r = x_{i_r}^2 + \\sum_{j=0}^{35} v_{\\text{base}}[j] x_j^2 + c_{r,1} ab + c_{r,2} cd$$\nwhere $\\sum_{j=0}^{35} v_{\\text{base}}[j] \\equiv 0 \\pmod{65537}$.\n\nConsequently, the reduced basis elements satisfy:\n$$U[i][0] = c_{i,1} - C_1 \\pmod{65537}$$\n$$U[i][1] = c_{i,2} - C_2 \\pmod{65537}$$\nwhere\n$$C_1 = \\sum_{j=0}^{35} v_{\\text{base}}[j] c_{j,1} \\pmod{65537} = 15309$$\n$$C_2 = \\sum_{j=0}^{35} v_{\\text{base}}[j] c_{j,2} \\pmod{65537} = 22765$$\n\nSubtracting $(C_1, C_2)$ from each $(c_{i,1}, c_{i,2})$ modulo 65537 gives the matrix $U$:\n\n<answer>[[47597,58215],[44630,50875],[5134,32454],[36221,56732],[42562,9023],[44094,43846],[13426,59038],[-4495,12581],[-8333,30019],[40521,41327],[11747,27560],[48381,58570],[50155,53755],[49331,39699],[29438,48492],[32572,57804],[42441,46586],[38880,24985],[47845,31698],[41752,2223],[1201,58334],[8653,2946],[-4638,22033],[44282,37564],[37476,47374],[33833,9548],[718,29401],[36251,22935],[5568,50881],[18766,37556],[46772,6072],[44577,3540],[5220,279],[32380,671],[37628,59376],[3996,21550]]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 179.65, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "medium", "escalation_round": 1}
